  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "This visualize the distribution of license status based on each state. Also, the audience can choose status of license that they are interested in. The Color is used to show the number of linces status in the specific state.\n",
    "I have used nominal scales since both States and License Status do not have order. On ther other hand, they are just different. Therefore, I chose nominal scale and did not choose ordinal scale.\n",
    "I did not do any transformation for the first plot. The main reason for not using transformation is because both x and y values are nominal data, therefore, I did not think I need any transformation.\n",
    "\n",
    "This might be interested for people who wanted to do license-related service; since it would be better to run a business in a state with many not renewed licenses."
   ]
